       ↓
ProductDynamicIndexListener / CatalogDynamicIndexListener
  (Kafka Consumer - Batch Processing)
       ↓
ProductIndexApplicationService / CatalogIndexApplicationService
  .indexProducts() / .indexCatalogs()
       ↓
ProductMergeStrategy / CatalogMergeStrategy
  .merge() - Deduplication & sets shouldFetch* flags
       ↓
ProductAssembleService / CatalogAssembleService
  .assemble() - TRIGGERS PROXY API CALLS
       ↓
ProxyApplicationService
  .fetchDependencies() - PARALLEL ASYNC CALLS
       ↓
CategoryService/BrandService/ManufacturerService/MallService
       ↓
CategoryRepositoryImpl/BrandRepositoryImpl/etc.
       ↓
